### Visual of the Circular Array

Think of it like this:
```
Slots:      0    1    2    3  ...  299
            ↑    ↑    ↑    ↑       ↑
Timestamp:  300  301  302  303    599
            ↑    ↑    ↑    ↑       ↑
Timestamp:  600  601  602  603    899
Same 300 slots keep getting reused in cycles. The times array acts as a label on each slot telling you which cycle it belongs to.



